  "description": {
    "pt": "falo de **game design**, **gamedev** e **jogos brasileiros** para quem faz e para quem quer fazer jogos. sou cofundador da Nano Knight Studio, professor de jogos digitais na FIAP e host da Rede Ronaldo Games. desde 2018 trabalho com design de sistemas, mecânicas, combate, game feel e level design.",
    "en": "I talk about **game design**, **gamedev** and **Brazilian games** for people who make games and people who want to. I'm co-founder of Nano Knight Studio, digital games professor at FIAP and host at Rede Ronaldo Games. Since 2018 I've worked on systems design, mechanics, combat, game feel and level design."
